cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this data, please cite the study page for the study you used
  (listed in README.md) and this repository, and carry the sample size and
  limitations with any number you reuse.
title: "AI Watermark Lab: open data"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "ignacio-sj"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ignacio-sj/ai-watermark-lab"
url: "https://www.aiwatermarkremoval.com/lab"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - AI watermark
  - text watermarking
  - Unicode
  - invisible characters
  - Claude
  - open data
abstract: >-
  Data, scripts and protocols for two studies: a census of invisible
  Unicode characters in 128 outputs from four Claude models, and a matrix
  of which of 18 invisible characters survive 12 code transformations.
  Neither study can detect a statistical text watermark. Scripts are MIT
  licensed.
